{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/170056-kindred-haunted-by-garou","id":170056,"title":"Kindred haunted by Garou","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-15T13:15:51-07:00","id":170056,"title":"Kindred haunted by Garou","content":"I have a character who wants to play a Native American inspired Gangrel. He wants to have the Haunted flaw. In looking it over, I was thinking that it would be kind-of cool for the sprit haunting him to have been a Garou ancestor. Is there any precedent for that? Or does something specific happen to Garou spirits after they die?<br /> <br /> (FWIW, I've never been a big Werewolf fan, so I don't have the books/PDFs to check this out on my own.)<br /> <br /> Thanks!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3271-iamtim","name":"iamtim","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T13:43:18-07:00","id":170093,"title":"","content":"You may want to check into Wraith then about that for supernatural ghosts (<i>Who can and who can not</i>).<br /> <br /> The Howling Void has a <a href=\"http://www.thehowlingvoid.com/owod-wraith-other-supers.html\" target=\"_blank\">section on that here</a>.<br /> Another way you can do that, is by <a href=\"http://dusk.wikia.com/wiki/Garou_Backgrounds_G-Z\" target=\"_blank\">Pastlives</a>. This Garou ancestor got defeated by your Gangrel in the past, so he keeps coming back now and then through his descendants. So some unknown Garou shows up and challenges your character for what seems like no reason at all until his Pastlife takes over and speaks through his mouth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":". 06-15-2014, 04:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T13:58:06-07:00","id":170102,"title":"","content":"Unless your chronicle is going involve a lot of Werewolf crossover, do it anyways. Potential conflicts with established Werewolf cosmology only matter if that cosmology will make other significant impacts on the story. Otherwise, stick with what makes the story more interesting for you and your player. So yes, Garou can become Wraiths/ghosts if it's a fun idea, at least sometimes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","name":"Demon Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"266"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T10:00:17-07:00","id":170830,"title":"","content":"Taken from Buried Secrets, pg 27:<br /> <br /> My vampire/mage/changeling/Garou character just died. Can I bring her back as a wraith?:<br /> <br /> Any vampire who is not diablerized and who did not reach Golconda before Final Death can become a wraith.<br /> Most Garou are reincarnated as opposed to becoming wraiths, but certain werewolves with a Wyrm taint on them can become Restless Dead.<br /> Any sort of mage can become a wraith, though she won\u2019t bring her Avatar across the Shroud.<br /> Only changelings killed by cold iron can become wraiths.<br /> <br /> Will my vampire still have all of his Disciplines once he becomes a wraith?:<br /> <br /> No. Any Awakened being of any type who becomes a wraith starts out as a basic wraith - no Disciplines, no Spheres, no rotes, no Gifts, cantrips or anything else.<br /> Most formerly powerful wraiths take a while to adjust to the Underworld (\u201cYou mean I can\u2019t throw fireballs anymore?\u201d), and for some, that adjustment period is too long.<br /> Also, a great many Awakened beings have racked up quite a few enemies before crossing the Shroud, and some of those enemies are certain to be waiting for them, with the benefit of years of wraithly experience and the shoe planted firmly on the other foot.<br /> <br /> As with other wraiths, an Awakened being\u2019s ghost\u2019s appearance will depend on how she viewed herself.<br /> A Garou could conceivably become a Crinos-formed wraith, but she would only have the shape, not the additional strength that Crinos form bestows upon the living.<br /> <br /> Hope some of that helps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I had a conscience once. Alas, I appear to have misplaced it.","edited":{"userid":1309,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1309-andreas-rayne","user":"Andreas Rayne","date":".  Page number added 06-16-2014, 01:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1309-andreas-rayne","name":"Andreas Rayne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T10:54:37-07:00","id":171772,"title":"","content":"Thanks for all the feedback. Ultimately I went with a garou haunter because it was really cool for the character. And that's pretty much why we do this, right? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3271-iamtim","name":"iamtim","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T23:26:29-07:00","id":172505,"title":"","content":"I see no reason why the &quot;Haunted&quot; flaw couldn't reflect a &quot;living&quot; spirit rather than a wraith. After all it's not like a vampire can tell the difference, right? i say go for it. Just be aware, if he's really out to get you, &quot;live&quot; spirits do agg damage... and so do his descendants... if you want it to be a wraith, though, you could easily just trade Garou for kinfolk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/612-the-cat-came-back","name":"The Cat Came Back","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar612_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}